<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγγονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet.
			Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγενής</span>
			, <i>congenital, inborn, natural</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρεμία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					11.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγγονόν [ἐστι] βροτοῖσι τὸν πεσόντα
					λακτίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					884
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>connected by blood, akin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1379
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἑστία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					12.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τέχναι</span> the arts
				<i>proper to his race</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>P.</u>
				8.60
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγόνῳ φρενί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					1039
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγόνων Ἐρινύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1190
				</span></i>
			: as Subst., <i>brother, sister</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				805
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				795
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. Διοσκόροιν Ἑλένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					441
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγγονοι</span>
			<i>kinsfolk</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				8.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				3.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1153
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>native, of one's country</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					911
				</span></i>
			.</div>
